Subject: [PATCH 06/28] =?UTF-8?q?0006:=20FLAG=5FSECURE=20=D0=B1=D0=B5?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=B7=20=D0=B2=D1=8B=D0=BA=D0=BB=D1=8E=D1=87=D0=B0=D1=82=D0=B5?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=BB=D1=8F?=
